--8<-- [start:description]
Show virtual packages from built-in detection, trusted [channel detectors](../../../workspace/multi_platform_configuration.md#virtual-package-detectors), and overrides.
Detector entries show results, cache use, failures, or skipped detection.
This command uses saved trust decisions and never prompts.

More information [here](../../../advanced/explain_info_command.md).
